Emerging Market Opportunities
The growing emphasis on credible methane reporting creates opportunities for independent audit firms, environmental consultancies, and specialist verification providers. Companies offering facility-level assurance, corporate inventory reviews, and supply-chain attestation can address different requirements across the energy sector.

Digital emissions records and improved data-management processes also create opportunities for providers that can support consistent documentation and measurement reconciliation. Recurring verification assignments, periodic audits, and additional facility assessments may offer further service opportunities as reporting programmes expand.

